<title>SRI LANKA: ADB TO SET UP OFFICE IN SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>ADB TO SET UP OFFICE IN SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Asian Development Bank (ADB) will soon set up an office in Sri Lanka, a government minister said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The ADB office, to be set up in October, will help improve the performance of the bank's loan portfolios, said Mangala Samaraweera, Minister of Posts, Telecommunication and Media.</p>
<p>&quot;It will also strengthen the ADB's capacity to focus on policy dialogues with the government,&quot; Samaraweera said.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka receives huge infrastructure project loans from ADB.</p>
</text>
